OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter still in hospital
OL,4,Aafter huge blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter remains in hospital on
OL,7,FTuesday, following a huge fire in
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent last Thursday which
OL,9,Fdestroyed four homes.
OL,11,FDozens more properties were badly
OL,12,Fdamaged and many were evacuated when
OL,13,Fthe blaze in the Sandyford area broke
OL,14,Fout near Sandy Road.
OL,16,FThe fire service said a total of six
OL,17,Ffirefighters were initially taken to
OL,18,Fhospital for smoke inhalation and heat
OL,19,Fexhaustion, with five of those later
OL,20,Fdischarged.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
