OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter still in hospital
OL,4,Aafter huge blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man and a 24-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman, both from Stoke-on-Trent, were
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of arson in
OL,9,Fconnection with the fire and have since
OL,10,Fbeen released on bail according to
OL,11,FStaffordshire Police.
